    {
      "id": "88187849-b5b6-4e99-a430-070e1d8302ff",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -288,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 736,
        "height": 816,
        "content": "## Continuous Supplier Risk Monitoring Agent\n\n## How it Works:\nThis workflow automates the \"Middle Office\" risk assessment. It triggers daily to fetch a supplier list, performs live web research on news and currency trends, and calculates a custom \"Smart Twist\" risk score. Depending on the risk level, it either creates high-priority Slack/Gmail or simply logs the data for a weekly executive report.\n\n## Setup Steps:\n\n1. Credentials: Connect your Google Sheets, Gmail, Slack, and Groq/OpenAI accounts.\n\n2. Sheet Setup: Ensure your \"Supplier Master\" has headers for Name, Delay Rate, and Rejection Rate.\n\n3. Audit Log: Create a second tab named Risk_Audit_Logs to store results.\n\n4. Activation: Test once manually, then toggle to \"Active\" for the daily 9 AM sync."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e5d42114-f036-4131-b8d1-103838431e2d",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        512,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1520,
        "height": 816,
        "content": "## Phase 1: Real-Time Research\n\nGroups the nodes responsible for external intelligence. This section fetches live news headlines and currency exchange rates. The Merge and Pre-AI Formatting nodes then consolidate this raw data into a clean structure for the AI to analyze."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "02d2e06d-11eb-4263-a89a-bd413311e3b8",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2144,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1040,
        "height": 576,
        "content": "## Phase 2: Intelligence & Decision Logic\n\nThis section transforms raw research into actionable data. Analyze Sentiment interprets news impact via LLM, while Calculate Final Risk Score applies weighted logic to internal KPIs. The Switch node then acts as the traffic controller, routing suppliers to specific action paths based on their 0–100 risk score."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "03b94e2b-c4d4-4811-894f-22f5f86141b7",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3264,
        256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1072,
        "height": 1056,
        "content": "## Phase 3: Response & Audit Logging\n\nThe execution layer of the loop. For High-Risk cases, AI generates a mitigation plan before firing Slack and Email alerts. Medium-Risk items trigger a watchlist notice. Finally, every result is logged to the Audit DB to ensure a permanent record for the final executive report."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "275183f5-6ec9-47a8-a28e-5e530cbcca0c",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2144,
        -48
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1040,
        "height": 544,
        "content": "## Phase 4: Executive Reporting Path\n\nTriggered via the \"Done\" port after the loop completes. This section pulls all logged assessments from today, uses JavaScript to remove redundant entries, and prompts AI to draft a high-level summary for leadership. The final result is sent as a single, consolidated daily report via Gmail."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
